OL,4,CBBC filming shows sick puppies       W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GWhen Katie Thornton paid #2,000 for  W5
OL,7,Ga nine-week-old puppy for her son,   W5
OL,8,Gshe knew it was a premium price -    W5
OL,9,Gbut was happy to be doing business   W5
OL,10,Gwith a "legit", council-approved     W5
OL,11,Gbreeder.                             W5
OL,12,                                      W5
OL,13,GBut Ozzy the Dobermann pup started   W5
OL,14,Gcoughing in the car on the way home, W5
OL,15,Gand within 48 hours he was in a      W5
OL,16,Gveterinary hospital receiving urgent W5
OL,17,Gtreatment for pneumonia.             W5
OL,18,                                      W5
OL,19,GSince then, his ongoing health       W5
OL,20,Gproblems mean Katie has racked up    W5
OL,21,Gmore than #5,000 in vet bills.       W5
OL,22,                                      W5
